  "notes": "The user may invoke the feature handoff directly with rough notes, or with a goal contract, research report, review, or litmus artifact. Discovery may recommend predecessors or successors, but prompt bodies never route the user. Verification stays usable independently for already completed work, and the feedback node stays one bounded apply-and-verify cycle."
